@dc:title "Context Analysis Bundle"
@dc:description "A bundle that includes all descriptions of the Egypt Agricultural Earth Observation Satellite concurrent design project. It is the reasoning and analysis scope of the project."
description bundle <https://context-analysis/bundle#> as d-bundle {
    uses <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/> as dc
    uses <https://www.modelware.io/sierra/bundle#>
    includes <https://context-analysis/stakeholder#>
    includes <https://context-analysis/requirements#>
    includes <https://context-analysis/components#>
    includes <https://context-analysis/parameters#>
}
